# Deployed tsumego zips: regenerable via pipeline/package_for_pwa.py from the
# raw SGFs in tsumegos/ + embeddings + ratings. The expensive-to-regenerate
# inputs stay in the repo; the packaged outputs do not.
/pwa/tsumegos/
# lookup.txt is another package_for_pwa output (tsumego_id -> zipHash -> size),
# copied into the gitignored dist/ at build time. Useless without the (ignored)
# zips it indexes, so it's regenerated, not tracked.
/pwa/lookup.txt

# IDEs and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

models/

# Pipeline-extracted activations: per-cell trunk vectors, ~tens of GB at fp16,
# regenerable via pipeline/extract_activations.py. Not for version control.
activations/

# Pre-projected per-cell K-dim embeddings (~1.3 GB at K=64). Written by
# pipeline/build_embedding.py after the PCA fit; consumed by
# pipeline/package_for_pwa.py. Reproducible from activations/ + pca.npz.
embeddings/joint/per_cell/

# Vast.ai orchestration
orchestration_state.json
.env
